<span id="A1.T5.2.15.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.15.5.1.1" class="ltx_p">Beginning with 4, each term is obtained by adding 9 to the previous one, so every member of the sequence is a number that leaves a remainder of 4 when divided by 9.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.15.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_align_top">3</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.16" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.2.16.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:11.4pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.16.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">P15</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.16.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.2.16.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:31.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.16.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">quasi-arithmetic</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.16.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.2.16.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:59.8pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.16.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.T5.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="4,13,22,32,40," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">4,13,22,32,40,</annotation></semantics></math>…</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.16.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
