<span id="A1.T5.2.16.5.1.1" class="ltx_p">Each consecutive gap cycles through adding nine, then nine again, then ten, and then eight.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.16.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_align_top">2</td></tr>
