<span id="A1.T5.2.18.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:59.8pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.18.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.T5.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5,14,29,50,77," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>29</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>77</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5,14,29,50,77,</annotation></semantics></math>…</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.18.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.2.18.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:37.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.18.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">GPT-4.1</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.18.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.2.18.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.18.5.1.1" class="ltx_p">In this series, each term increases by consecutive odd numbers multiplied by three: specifically, the difference between each consecutive pair rises by 6 each time (i.e., 9, 15, 21, 27, …), so each term adds six more than the previous difference.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.18.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_align_top">1</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.19" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.19.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.2.19.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:11.4pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.19.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">P18</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.19.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.2.19.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:31.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.19.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">difference</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.19.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.2.19.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:59.8pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.19.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.T5.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5,14,29,50,77," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>29</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>77</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5,14,29,50,77,</annotation></semantics></math>…</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.19.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.2.19.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:37.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.19.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">o3</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.19.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.2.19.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.19.5.1.1" class="ltx_p">The difference between consecutive terms rises by six each time (9, 15, 21, 27, …), so the nth term is given by <math id="A1.T5.m30" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3n^{2}+2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3n^{2}+2</annotation></semantics></math>.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.19.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_align_top">1</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.20" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.20.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.2.20.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:11.4pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.20.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">P19</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.20.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.2.20.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:31.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.20.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">difference</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.20.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.2.20.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:59.8pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.20.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.T5.m31" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5,14,29,50,77," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>29</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>77</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5,14,29,50,77,</annotation></semantics></math>…</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.20.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.2.20.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:37.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.20.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">o4-mini</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.20.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.2.20.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.20.5.1.1" class="ltx_p">Each term equals three times the square of its position in the sequence plus two.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.20.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_align_top">2</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.21" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.21.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.2.21.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:11.4pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.21.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">P20</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.21.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.2.21.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:31.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.21.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">difference</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.21.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.2.21.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:59.8pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.21.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.T5.m32" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5,14,29,50,77," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>29</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>77</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5,14,29,50,77,</annotation></semantics></math>…</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.21.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.2.21.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:37.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.21.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Gemini2.5</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.21.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.2.21.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.21.5.1.1" class="ltx_p">The regularity is that the difference between consecutive terms increases by a fixed value.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.21.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_align_top">1</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.22" class="ltx_tr">
