<span id="A2.T8.2.7.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Each number in the series is formed by alternately adding 3 and then 6 to the previous number.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T8.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T8.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb">
<span id="A2.T8.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A2.T8.2.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">random</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T8.2.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb">
<span id="A2.T8.2.8.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:79.7pt;">
<span id="A2.T8.2.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A2.T8.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="54,74,24,5,23," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>54</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>74</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">54,74,24,5,23,</annotation></semantics></math> …</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T8.2.8.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb">
<span id="A2.T8.2.8.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A2.T8.2.8.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">o3</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T8.2.8.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb">
<span id="A2.T8.2.8.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:241.9pt;">
<span id="A2.T8.2.8.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Every succeeding term is obtained from the preceding one by reversing its digits and then adding or subtracting 29 alternately.</span>
</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
